            "id": 76776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store the string <code>\"high\"</code> in <code>my_answer</code> make the comparison <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"high\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A comparison is <code>False</code> only when the two strings are not equal.</p><p>Store <code>\"high\"</code> in <code>my_answer</code> and compare it so the code prints <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"high\"</code>, followed by <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 76774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store a string in <code>item_2</code> to make the result of the comparison <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"item_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_duplicate = item_1 == item_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"pipe\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>is_duplicate</code> becomes <code>True</code> only when both items are the exact same string.</p><p>Store a different string in <code>item_2</code>. Check if the items are equal, making <code>is_duplicate</code> <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"item_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_duplicate = item_1 == item_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pipe\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"pipe\"</code>, followed by <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
