          {
            "title": "Inequality operator",
            "id": 76680,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a string isn't equal to another string, we use the <strong>inequality operator</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a string isn't equal to another string, we use the <strong>inequality operator</strong>.</p><p>Compare the two strings so the code prints <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 76678,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the left string isn't equal to the right string, as in <code>\"subscribed\" != \"rejected\"</code>, the result is <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"subscribed\"</code>, followed by <code>!=</code>, and finally <code>\"rejected\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Two different strings are not equal, so checking them with the inequality operator gives <code>True</code>.</p><p>Print <code>True</code> by comparing <code>\"subscribed\"</code> on the left with <code>\"rejected\"</code> on the right.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"subscribed\"</code>, followed by <code>!=</code>, and finally <code>\"rejected\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 76725,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the string on the left is equal to the string on the right, as in <code>\"subscribed\" != \"subscribed\"</code>, the result is <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!</code>, followed by <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When two strings are identical, checking whether they are <em>not</em> equal gives <code>False</code>.</p><p>Compare the string with an identical copy of itself so the code prints <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;unsubscribed&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!=</code>, followed by <code>\"subscribed\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
