            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To store the result of a comparison in a variable, we use the <code>=</code> sign.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"same = \" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(same)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To store the result of a comparison in a variable, we use a single <code>=</code> sign.</p><p>Store the comparison in <code>same</code> and check the two strings so it prints <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"same = \" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(same)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
